  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Social Learning For Kids With Disabilities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through My Eyes is working to inspire change and create a shift in the narrative  surrounding persons with disabilities in Kenya. One way we intend to achieve  this is to build an inclusive play center for disabled kids. This center will hold up to 250 kids and be a warm, welcoming home where the kids will receive personalized care  with the intent of improving their personal, social &amp; emotional skills. We are intent in making sure  that a child with a disability lives to their full potential.</narrative>
  </description>
